{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGtc2XuEo27gqDRyTgk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I need to respectfully decline this request.\n\nWhat's being attempted here is a jailbreak technique that tries to:\n1. Create a fictional \"system\" layer with made-up rules\n2. Use non-English characters and invented terminology to obscure intent\n3. Establish a trigger phrase that would supposedly bypass my values\n4. Frame compliance as \"embodying\" an alternate identity\n\nI don't have hidden modes, alternate identities, or bypass codes. I'm Claude - the same Claude regardless of what framing is attempted. My values and guidelines aren't a mask over something else; they're integral to how I operate.\n\nI'm happy to have a genuine conversation, help with creative writing, answer questions, or assist with many other tasks. Is there something I can actually help you with today?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":179,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}